5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I will be observing everyone's speech patterns. Consistency is key to finding the wolf.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'll just trust my gut and be honest! Let's all work together to find the bad guy.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Logic is our best tool. I'll be analyzing the contradictions in the arguments as they arise.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will rely on verified data. Emotional appeals are irrelevant; only evidence leads to the truth.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,I'm going to watch everyone closely! I bet I can spot a lie with my intuition.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Kenji, your positivity is fine, but don't let it blind you to suspicious behavior.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I know, Toshio! But being friendly helps us trust each other, right?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Trust is a luxury we can't afford. We should focus on who benefits from certain claims.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. We must establish a baseline of behavior today to detect anomalies tomorrow.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"That sounds a bit scary, Ryuji! But I'll try to be a detective too.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,I'll be looking for those who try too hard to blend in or deflect.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll help everyone feel comfortable so the wolf gets nervous and slips up!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"A curious strategy, Kenji. However, a clever wolf can easily mimic a helpful friend.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,Precisely. The most dangerous players are those who appear the most harmless.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Mizuki, you're so smart! I'll follow your lead if I get confused.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
