31,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"We have no deaths yet, but the atmosphere has changed. Who feels out of place?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Everyone seems okay to me! But we have to pick someone, right? That's hard.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We should look for those who are being overly quiet or too aggressive in their logic.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I have information. Mizuki is the werewolf. The data is absolute.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"What?! Ryuji, are you the Seer? I trust you because you're so serious!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, that is a very bold claim for the first day. Are you certain?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, Mizuki? No way! She's been so helpful and logical. Are you sure, Ryuji?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,This is a classic play. Ryuji is likely the wolf trying to frame me immediately to win.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,My role is the Seer. I have no reason to lie about a verified result.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Mizuki looks surprised, but Ryuji doesn't look like he's joking at all.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"If Ryuji is the wolf, he's taking a huge risk. If he's the Seer, we win now.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Kenji,,But what if he's just mistaken? I don't want to vote out a friend by mistake!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly, Kenji. Think about the risk. If we execute a villager, the wolf wins easily.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,The risk of keeping a known werewolf is far greater than the risk of trusting the Seer.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I believe Ryuji. He's too calm to be lying about something this big.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Toshio,,The probability favors Ryuji's claim given his personality. I will vote for Mizuki.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I still feel bad, but if everyone else is sure... I'll go with the group.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"You are all making a logical error. I am human. Please, reconsider.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
